+ * @param {number[]} xs
+ * @param {number} p from 0 to 100, both included
+ * @returns {number}
+ * @throws {TypeError} if xs is not an array, any item is not a number (including a hole in a sparse
+ *   array; numeric strings and BigInts are not converted), or p is not a number
